    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42316" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέτ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, mostly in pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rowers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.280
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				39
			</span></i>(anap.), <i><span class="en">
