				6.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.31
			</span></i>, etc. : sg., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				542
			</span></i> : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυλίκων
